  "details": "- CVE-2018-8778: fix buffer under-read in String#unpack\n- CVE-2018-16396: propagate taint flags in Array#pack and String#unpack\n- CVE-2018-8780: reject NUL bytes in Dir paths\n- CVE-2018-16395: fix OpenSSL::X509::Name equality check\n- CVE-2015-1855: make OpenSSL hostname matching follow RFC 6125\n- CVE-2018-8777: fix DoS by large request in WEBrick\n- CVE-2019-16201: fix ReDoS in WEBrick Digest authentication\n- CVE-2020-25613: fix HTTP request smuggling in WEBrick\n- CVE-2021-41819: fix cookie prefix spoofing in CGI::Cookie.parse\n- CVE-2025-27219: fix DoS in CGI::Cookie.parse\n- CVE-2021-33621: fix HTTP response splitting in CGI\n- CVE-2025-27220: fix ReDoS in CGI::Util#escapeElement\n- CVE-2018-6914: fix directory traversal in Tempfile and Dir.mktmpdir\n- CVE-2019-16255: fix code injection in Shell#[] and Shell#test\n- CVE-2021-41817: fix ReDoS in Date parsing methods\n- CVE-2026-80212: fix unbounded class registration for unknown DNS types\n- CVE-2021-28965: fix XML round-trip issue in REXML\n- CVE-2024-49761: fix ReDoS in REXML\n- CVE-2017-10784: escape control characters in all WEBrick log messages",
